{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1d2e358cc86bf0660d93a40e1da5ecbac3ff3af9dab9e411642f6cbefdfb0161","ja":"わあっ！？　び、ビックリした～……。\nどうしたんですか、紬さん？","zh":"哇啊！？吓、吓我一跳～……。\n怎么了吗，紬？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4a0c6afc1f6127f48ad36212a2a28db04504b9f74268b312ca2de4b4e44845c0","ja":"ライブが始まる前に、\nこれを冷蔵庫に入れておこうと……。","zh":"在演出开始之前，\n想把这个先放进冰箱里……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ca4cc1ca619be50263d5c13b3cce8b656da96f9c09686419cfca65537bd70804","ja":"これ……って、ええっ！？\nそのようかん、もしかして……！？","zh":"这个……等等，诶诶！？\n那个羊羹，难道说……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2d9528cfbadcebd69aa97cbbf9016d4197a99d7ae751c4c01804a53107224750","ja":"はい、あのモールにあったお店のものです。\n昨日、ちょうど近くを通る用事があったので。","zh":"是的，就是在那个商场里的店买的。\n昨天刚好有事路过附近。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"449e9aa1a3932f8b7821d27d006bac2f83b847f86dfd586d1439698677b3e6b8","ja":"あれ？　もしかして2人も、\nお土産を買ってきてたの？","zh":"哎？难道2个人也都\n买了特产回来吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"26f52edf3edff84c1ad5d05a3df9b605694f263d998b543b508531efbe9cf9c6","ja":"アタシもあのモールの近くで仕事があったから、\nお土産にチョコ買ってたんだ！","zh":"我也正好在那家商场附近有工作，\n就买了巧克力当伴手礼！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1daf3c611fb867b5d26567e480477235e542ad3f4a80dc8b5eae4978ad0da4e0","ja":"あたしも、アップルパイを買ってきたよぉ。\nみんなと、おいしいりんごを食べたくってねぇ♪","zh":"我也买了苹果派回来哦～。\n因为想和大家一起吃美味的苹果嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f9a91702f8b90f78559d2118a11afaa345ddda04205c016d5a7b41ec056053b7","ja":"……あはははっ！\nみんな、こっそりお土産買ってたんですね！","zh":"……啊哈哈哈哈！\n原来大家都偷偷买了特产啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"b27957e2f879cdff774a93f271b5729ba6ff3f0a1f0549dfdf8a161c86e5de23","ja":"どうやらそのようですね……。","zh":"看来似乎是这样呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"927e85f9eda4967aebed707864ba6bd7fecbc95c14967b7c616b32aa48793442","ja":"（でも、そっか……●●●●プロデューサーさんに\nお土産を用意したの、わたしだけじゃないんだ……）","zh":"（不过，也是啊……准备了伴手礼送给\n制作人的，并不是只有我一个人啊……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"54ed99fa91aeda724cb0174d7df5d1090717b0a50988c32d8537a60653088e8f","ja":"……よし！　作戦変更！\n今日のライブは、い～っぱい頑張って……。","zh":"……好！改变作战！\n今天的演出，我要超～级努力……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1486.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"8f765dcaef7bc723beaee403426263795193bc26758c7d11c4f91c2e350995ef","ja":"パフォーマンスで、●●●●プロデューサーさんに\n元気になってもらっちゃお～っと！","zh":"我要用表演让●●●●制作人\n打起精神来～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
